  "2026-11-09T00:43:31.185Z",codex-agent,"Final round-four results: both findings are valid and fixed. PRRT_kwDOVlkMx861FaWd closes the rule that a normalized filesystem root is not a private home identity; PRRT_kwDOVlkMx861FaWn closes literal PATH-separator detection across raw/cooked templates, escaped/embedded strings and static quoted/template keys/accesses. The shared guard covers SDK and CLI JSON/TOON writes, and package-wide scans found no remaining instances. npm run release:check PASSED in 2552 seconds with 92/92 tests, zero skips/failures, and 100 percent of 598 statements, 334 branches, 169 functions and 484 lines across nine runtime modules. Its complete packed acceptance passed 45 files, 62 CLI commands per npm/Bun manager, no-git SDK/CLI and exact Node 22.19.0/26.13.0 checks; its revert acceptance passed 62 red/62 restored-green proofs, 4 clean-build proofs and 3 wrong-code probes. Standalone focused, final-source revert and packed tests also passed. Typecheck, lint, zero duplication, 100 documented declarations, production audit (zero vulnerabilities), package/changelog/attestation/identity/health checks passed. The just-started bun run release:check was intentionally stopped after 40 seconds, after its initial static gates, because two measured full local runs would exceed the task approximate 60-minute limit. This is missing full Bun certification, not a pass or an assertion failure; .github/workflows/ci.yml runs the full Bun gate in its Node 26 job. Final-head CI and renewed review remain pending at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-case/pull/1/checks . No pm CLI/SDK defect or out-of-scope code defect was found. Keep review threads untouched and this item in progress for orchestrator verification."
